    {
      "uid": "zhcn:68a2348d24328be7624aac20",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "国内史上第一位达成无败的三冠赛马娘，\n风靡一世的鲁道夫象征。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d3f954b8003a5c873301c88b20dfba223f82f80bdb65712e9827b2f42fb6151",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
