    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5735f875df869b39ac170623",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在爆炸般的欢呼声包围下，\n天狼星象征头也不回地\n搭上了飞机。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f08a9b9cabcbe37819e09b1b8ad2d0445d06a519bf020e485737d59e034b49d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070111.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        50,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/50/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9e34558199489666adc2a33",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "轮子开始转动，飞机飘离地面──\n最终，她飞向了广阔的天空。",
      "source_fingerprint": "87b76dbce930e0c6f9a02384d9e3eebbd43b7ef40e360c95bdbf09effa6a1ed8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
